message: "If you use or reference this software, please cite it as below."
title: "Effie Entry Expert (艾菲奖报奖顾问)"
abstract: >-
  An independent, third-party AI Skill for Effie Awards entry strategy and
  marketing effectiveness analysis. It combines professional workflows, a 2026
  rules snapshot, deterministic local checks, and human-in-the-loop review.
  It is not an official Effie product and does not grant submission
  authorization or guarantee award outcomes. The MIT license applies to
  original code, scripts, schemas, and workflows only; official rules and
  category definitions remain the property of their respective owners.
authors:
